n is used when User Account Control is enabled, the application does not require administrative privilege, and the user does not choose to start the program using Run as administrator.\r\nevt-02584|2026-05-06T00:00:54.711Z|4673|WS-06.corp.example|WS-06$|A privileged service was called.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-20\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWS-06$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x3E4\r\r\n\r\r\nService:\r\r\n\tServer:\tSecurity\r\r\n\tService Name:\t-\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t0x1f04\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\wbem\\WmiPrvSE.exe\r\r\n\r\r\nService Request Information:\r\r\n\tPrivileges:\t\tSeProfileSingleProcessPrivilege\r\nevt-02585|2026-05-06T00:00:54.711Z|4690|WS-06.corp.example|WS-06$|An attempt was made to duplicate a handle to an object.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-20\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWS-06$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x3E4\r\r\n\r\r\nSource Handle Information:\r\r\n\tSource Handle ID:\t0x78\r\r\n\tSource Process ID:\t0x1f04\r\r\n\r\r\nNew Handle Information:\r\r\n\tTarget Handle ID:\t0x2e80\r\r\n\tTarget Process ID:\t0x4\r\nevt-02586|2026-05-06T00:00:54.712Z|4658|WS-06.corp.example|WS-06$|The handle to an object was closed.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject :\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-20\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWS-06$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x3E4\r\r\n\r\r\nObject:\r\r\n\tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r\r\n\tHandle ID:\t\t0x2e80\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t\t0x1f04\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\wbem\\WmiPrvSE.exe\r\nevt-02587|2026-05-06T00:00:54.712Z|4656|WS-06.corp.example|WS-06$|A handle to an object was requested.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-20\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWS-06$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x3E4\r\r\n\r\r\nObject:\r\r\n\tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r\r\n\tObject Type:\t\tKey\r\r\n\tObject Name:\t\t\\REGISTRY\\MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\